---
// Mission.astro
---

<section class="mission" id="about">
  <div class="mission-inner">
  <div class="mission-label">Our Mission</div>

  <div class="mission-content">
    <h2>Equal access to justice, for every Mainer, in every county.</h2>
    <p>
      At the Maine Volunteer Lawyers Project, we believe that your ZIP code or
      income should never determine whether you can access expert legal help.
      Civil legal problems like evictions, custody disputes, and debt collection can
      derail lives when faced without representation.
    </p>
    <p>
      VLP bridges that gap by building a robust network of dedicated volunteer
      attorneys, streamlining the referral process, and expanding our reach to
      those in greatest need across Maine.
    </p>

    <div class="mission-values">
      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>Access</h4>
        <p>No Maine resident should be turned away from justice due to their ability to pay.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>Expertise</h4>
        <p>Every client is matched with a licensed attorney experienced in their area of need.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>Community</h4>
        <p>We strengthen Maine's legal community through a culture of pro bono service.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 96px 80px;
  }

  .mission-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .mission-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .mission-label::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--blue);
  }

  .mission-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .mission-content p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .mission-values {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .value-card {
    border-top: 2px solid var(--blue);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
  .value-card h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .value-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .mission { padding: 72px 48px; }
    .mission-values { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mission { padding: 56px 20px; }
    .mission-values { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  }
</style>
